    {
      "id": "61951275f71856a7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Needs Processed\n\n```dataview\nTABLE scope, status, \"Note Created\"\nFROM \"\"\nWHERE contains(file.tags, \"readwise_inbox\")\nSORT updated desc\n```",
      "x": -358,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 420
    },
    {
      "id": "bde782b6582915a3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Projects\n\n### In progress\n```dataview\ntable priority, status, domain\nfrom \"01 Projects\"\nwhere status = \"active\"\nsort priority asc\n```\n### Backlog\n```dataview\ntable priority, status, domain\nfrom \"01 Projects\"\nwhere status = \"backlog\" or status = null\nsort priority asc\n```",
      "x": 360,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 880
    },
    {
      "id": "2f3654ecab4e7f1b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Untagged Notes\n```dataview\nLIST\nFROM \"\"\nWHERE !file.tags OR length(file.tags) = 0\n```",
      "x": -358,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 440
    },
    {
      "id": "023be2784a61108f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Projects To Update\n```dataview\nLIST\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE !type OR !status OR !priority OR !domain\n```\n\n",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "6db231fdb9c869e9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Content To Create\n```dataview\nTABLE content-type, status\nWHERE type = \"content-idea\"\n```",
      "x": -358,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "9b990c6caf80aa8b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Projects by Domain\n\n### 💼 HPE\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"hpe\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n\n### 🎓 CWRU\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"cwru\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n\n### 🚀 Learn Fast\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"learn-fast\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n\n### 🏠 Personal\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"personal\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n\n### 🍰 Preheat to 350\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"preheat-350\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n\n### 💎 Paige Creations\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"paige-creations\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n\n### 💻 Freelancing\n```dataview\nTABLE file.mtime as \"Last Modified\"\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND domain = \"freelancing\"\nSORT file.mtime DESC\n```\n",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 2100
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Projects Needing Reconciliation\n\n*Active projects missing a Todoist or Drive link. Target state: empty.*\n*See [[99 Meta/Project Reconciliation]].*\n\n```dataview\nTABLE status, domain, todoist, drive\nFROM \"01 Projects\"\nWHERE type = \"project\" AND status = \"active\" AND (!todoist OR !drive)\nSORT domain ASC\n```\n"
    }
  ],
  "edges": []
}